  "title": "Hungarian Revolution of 1848",
  "summary": "Revolution and war of independence in the Kingdom of Hungary against Habsburg rule. Kossuth's Diet speech of 3 March 1848 set it in motion, and a crowd led by Petőfi rose in Pest on 15 March. Austria, aided by Russia, defeated it when the Hungarian army capitulated at Világos on 13 August 1849.",
